// APT29 2018 Phishing Campaign CommandLine Indicators | T1218.011 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/APT29-CozyBear/proc_creation_win_apt_apt29_phishing_campaign_indicators.yml
process.command_line:*\-noni\ \-ep\ bypass\ $* OR (process.command_line:*cyzfc.dat,* AND process.command_line:*PointFunctionCall*)
